We are pleased to inform you that the Meeting of the Board of Directors of the Company was held on Saturday, 24th October 2026 in which the Board has taken the following decisions: -

1. Recommendation for change in the designation of Mrs. Radhica Sharma (DIN: 06811597) from Whole-time Director designated as Joint Managing Director to Managing director of the Company;

2. Recommendation for change in the designation of Mr. Kunal Jain (DIN: 01475424) from Whole-time Director designated as Executive Director to Joint Managing director of the Company;

3. Approval for appointment of Mrs. Pramila Jain (DIN: 12011353) as an additional director and further as the Whole-time Director of the Company and designated as Executive Director for a period of 3 (three) years with effect from 24th October, 2026;
    
4. Approval for appointment of Mrs. Pramila Jain (DIN: 12011353) Executive Director, as the Chairperson of the Company with effect from 24th October, 2026;
